<title>FINLAND: Finnish raw wood prices rise further in Sept - METLA.</title>
<headline>Finnish raw wood prices rise further in Sept - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices rose further in September (weeks 37-40), building on their rise in August (weeks 32-35), the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	    Sept '96    Aug '96     1995	H2 '95	H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	  95.40	86.90    93.00	 93.20	 92.90</p>
<p> Spruce     123.00     115.00   109.70	109.00	110.20</p>
<p> Birch	 92.20	87.70    98.20	 98.00	 98.40</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	    Sept '96    Aug '96     1995	 H2 '95     H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	 243.80     239.30   247.10	 244.60     249.30</p>
<p> Spruce     203.20     197.00   197.60	 192.40     201.00</p>
<p> Birch	242.90     239.00   244.10	 240.70     246.70</p>
<p>A METLA official said the absence of published figures covering week 36 was due to a technical problem and that actual data for week 36 did not change the trend of rising raw wood prices.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
